sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Developer,Quay: Flow 1: Image Build Pipeline
        participant Developer as Developer (PR)
        participant GitHub as GitHub Actions<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.3
        participant Matrix as gen_gha_matrix_jobs.py
        participant Sandbox as sandbox.py +<br/>buildinputs (Go)
        participant Podman as Podman/Docker Build
        participant RedHat as Red Hat Registries<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
        participant PyPI as PyPI<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
        participant Quay as quay.io<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
        participant Manifests as manifests/base/<br/>params.env

        Developer->>GitHub: Push PR / Merge
        GitHub->>Matrix: Generate CI matrix<br/>(Makefile all-images + git diff)
        Matrix-->>GitHub: Image build matrix
        GitHub->>Sandbox: Create sandboxed<br/>build directory
        Sandbox->>Podman: Minimal build context<br/>(static Dockerfile analysis)
        Podman->>RedHat: Pull UBI9 base image<br/>Auth: Pull secret
        RedHat-->>Podman: registry.access.redhat.com/ubi9/python-312
        Podman->>PyPI: Install Python packages<br/>(micropipenv from Pipfile.lock)
        PyPI-->>Podman: Package artifacts
        Note over Podman: Multi-stage build:<br/>Base → Variant layers<br/>CUDA/ROCm if applicable
        Podman->>Quay: Push built image<br/>Auth: Quay token
        Quay-->>Podman: Image digest (SHA256)
        GitHub->>Manifests: Update params.env<br/>with new digest
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 2: Workbench Deployment (Runtime)
        participant User as User (Browser)
        participant Ingress as OpenShift Ingress<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.3
        participant RBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>Sidecar
        participant NGINX as NGINX Proxy<br/>(CodeServer/RStudio only)
        participant Workbench as Workbench Process<br/>Jupyter 8888/TCP<br/>CodeServer/RStudio 8787/TCP
        participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.3

        User->>Ingress: HTTPS request<br/>Auth: OAuth (OpenShift)
        Ingress->>RBAC: Forward request<br/>TLS terminated
        RBAC->>RBAC: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(verify namespace access)
        alt Jupyter Workbench
            RBAC->>Workbench: HTTP 8888/TCP<br/>(pod-local, no TLS)
            Workbench-->>RBAC: JupyterLab response
        else CodeServer / RStudio
            RBAC->>NGINX: HTTP 8787/TCP<br/>(pod-local, no TLS)
            NGINX->>Workbench: Proxy to code-server/rstudio<br/>localhost:8787
            Note over NGINX: Activity logging (JSON)<br/>WebSocket upgrade support<br/>proxy_read_timeout 20d
            Workbench-->>NGINX: Response
            NGINX-->>RBAC: Proxied response
        end
        RBAC-->>Ingress: Authenticated response
        Ingress-->>User: HTTPS response

        Note over NGINX,Workbench: Pod Culling Flow
        loop Every 30s
            Note right of NGINX: ODH Notebook Controller<br/>polls /api/kernels/
            NGINX->>NGINX: FastCGI → access.cgi<br/>(check activity log)
            NGINX-->>NGINX: Last activity timestamp
        end

        Workbench->>K8sAPI: ServiceAccount token<br/>TLS 1.3 / HTTPS
        K8sAPI-->>Workbench: Cluster resources
    end
